Base SHA (merge-base with origin/main): 02a44baa2dcaa5b916e0168f344625059b146749

Scope of change
---------------
- New feature module src/features/utilities: types, constants, status, schemas,
  idempotency, errors, api, queries, index plus components TopupForm,
  BillPaymentForm, PaymentSummary, OrderStatusPanel, UtilitiesWorkspace.
- src/pages/UtilitiesPage.tsx reduced to a 8-line thin page that renders
  UtilitiesWorkspace; no axios/api import, no mock data, no setTimeout, no
  Math.random, no hardcoded balance/phone/sample buttons.
- Endpoints (through Gateway, base /api):
  POST /utilities/topup                body {phone, amount}, Idempotency-Key
  GET  /utilities/bills/lookup         query provider, customerCode
  POST /utilities/bills/pay            body {provider, customerCode, amount},
                                       Idempotency-Key
  GET  /utilities/orders/{orderId}     order tracking (encodeURIComponent)
  POST /payments/{paymentId}/confirm   X-Transaction-Token from PinModal
  GET  /wallets/me                     available balance (existing wallet hook)
- Money stays a string end-to-end; comparisons use BigInt helpers from
  lib/format; there is no Number() conversion of money anywhere in the feature.
- Validation mirrors utilities-service: VN mobile phone (03/05/07/08/09, +84
  normalised to 0), exactly the 6 allowed denominations, provider/customerCode
  patterns, positive integer bill amount taken ONLY from the lookup response.
- Idempotency: key bound to the payload intent (TOPUP|phone|amount or
  BILL|provider|customerCode|amount); retry after an unknown outcome reuses the
  same key, editing the form produces a new key. Key lives in a useRef only.
- Retry policy: no response / 408 / 502 / 504 / UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE /
  GATEWAY_TIMEOUT on checkout show a "Thu lai" banner and resend the same key;
  definite 4xx never auto-retries. Unknown outcome on confirm does not confirm
  again, it switches to order polling.
- PIN flow: PinModal receives paymentId and amount from the created order; the
  transactionToken is passed straight into paymentApi.confirmPayment and is
  never stored in React/Zustand/localStorage/sessionStorage.
- Polling: TanStack refetchInterval every 2s, stops at SUCCESS, FAILED,
  REFUNDED, REFUND_FAILED; REFUNDED is displayed explicitly; wallet query is
  invalidated on a terminal status.
- Error mapping to Vietnamese by backend code, incl. INVALID_PHONE,
  INVALID_AMOUNT, INVALID_PROVIDER, INVALID_CUSTOMER_CODE,
  IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REQUIRED, LIMIT_EXCEEDED, BILL_NOT_FOUND,
  BILL_AMOUNT_MISMATCH, PROVIDER_TIMEOUT, PIN_*, TXN_TOKEN_*, PAYMENT_*.
- "Mo phong" badge/notice kept on both the top-up and the bill-payment tab.
- docs/handover/utilities.md created per TEMPLATE.md, documenting contract
  shapes, discount-only semantics, removed UI fields, PIN flow, polling and the
  backend gaps (K13 PHONE_TOPUP/BILL_PAYMENT, discount not credited, no
  provider catalogue).
- Tests: tests/utilities.test.ts (node, API/schema/error/polling, 14 tests) and
  src/test/utilities.test.tsx (vitest + MSW, 8 UI tests: 4 states, top-up +
  PIN + SUCCESS, retry keeps key, edit gives new key, double-click, REFUNDED
  and polling stop, bill lookup + pay with lookup amount, BILL_NOT_FOUND).
- Dependency note: npm install --no-package-lock --no-audit --no-fund was used
  (the committed package-lock.json is out of sync with package.json); the
  lockfile was not modified.

